classDiagram
    direction TB

    class ToolGateway {
        -PolicyEngine _policy
        -ToolRegistry _registry
        -ToolCallStore _store
        +call(tool_name, arguments, capability, task_id, ctx) ToolResult
    }
    class PolicyEngine {
        -list _global_rules
        -dict _tool_rules
        +default(tool_registry) PolicyEngine
        +authorize(capability, tool_name, args, ctx)
    }
    class PolicyRule {
        <<abstract>>
        +check(capability, tool_name, arguments, ctx)*
    }
    class GlobalRule {
        <<abstract>>
        作用于所有工具
    }
    class ToolRule {
        <<abstract>>
        作用于指定工具集合
    }
    class WhitelistRule {
        +check() 已注册 + agent 有权限
    }
    class BashExecGuardRule {
        +check() bash_exec 参数校验
    }

    class ToolRegistry {
        +register_tools(definitions, name)
        +register_control_tools(...)
        +register_mcp_stdio(...) / register_mcp_http(...)
        +get(name) ToolDefinition
        +to_llm_tools(names) list~LLMTool~
    }
    class ToolDefinition {
        name, description, input_schema
        handler, is_control
    }

    ToolGateway --> PolicyEngine
    ToolGateway --> ToolRegistry
    ToolGateway --> ToolCallStore : 审计（脱敏后）
    PolicyEngine o-- PolicyRule
    PolicyRule <|-- GlobalRule
    PolicyRule <|-- ToolRule
    GlobalRule <|-- WhitelistRule
    ToolRule <|-- BashExecGuardRule
    ToolRegistry o-- ToolDefinition
    note for ToolGateway "六步：授权 → 审计 RUNNING → 执行 → 审计完成 → 推 SSE → 截断输出"
